DTEND:20250517T204000Z
DTSTAMP:20250517T190000Z
UID:GSv5HiOMmj
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 88 mins (1h28m)\n\nIn this elliptically told melodra
 ma that was Lithuania’s submission for the 2025 Academy Awards®\, two f
 amilies must confront lingering resentments when tragedy strikes during a 
 lakeside weekend summer vacation. Winner of Best Director at the 2024 Loca
 rno Film Festival. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/drowning
 -dry\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Shoreline CC Theater (Thu 22 May\, 8:30 PM
 )
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
